ps://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/vaner-org/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118624#pullrequestreview-4118449818","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118624","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118624#pullrequestreview-4118449818"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118624"}},"submitted_at":"2026-04-16T05:11:43Z","commit_id":"914940a1c80b8be605e6f9bbab810e91db54916a"},{"id":4129894476,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc72KTBM","user":{"login":"allenwp","id":17506573,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NTA2NTcz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17506573?u=6e9313e254649f6dc55e92536596487ac10bf5a2&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp","html_url":"https://github.com/allenwp","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/allenwp/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118624#pullrequestreview-4129894476","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118624","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118624#pullrequestreview-4129894476"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118624"}},"submitted_at":"2026-04-17T15:04:47Z","commit_id":"914940a1c80b8be605e6f9bbab810e91db54916a"},{"id":4148558660,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc73RftE","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I have mixed feelings about this PR.\r\n\r\nYou've covered the pros quite well, I think, and I agree with your rationale. \r\nHowever, by using a template, we run into the typical \"ambitious template\" problem: It shoehorns descriptions into the chosen schema, whether it fits or not.\r\nYour headings are well chosen, and I think they fit the majority of pull requests well. However, here are my specific concerns:\r\n\r\nFor one, pull requests that are small and trivial (e.g. quick bug fix) might get an **overly verbose** description, making it harder to understand the change at face value.\r\n\r\nPull requests that are more complicated than the average (e.g. new feature) typically require an **even more verbose** description. We have [guidelines for PR descriptions](https://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/pull_requests/pull_request_guidelines.html#explain-your-contributions) in the contributing docs. I'm missing the following from your template:\r\n\r\n- Summary of changes (useful to understand the contribution without reading the whole description)\r\n- Technical overview (useful to describe the changes in prose, filling in what the code can't cover)\r\n- Testing (useful because PRs should be tested, and we have guidelines for some types of PRs)\r\n- Discussion (half covered by the 'uncertain' heading)\r\n- Additional work (useful if the PR needs work / follow-up PRs are planned)\r\n\r\nNext, PRs might be **inadequately described** by the headings. Like I said above, the headings are generally good, but I personally tend to switch out my PR description format depending on what the PR does. With a template, we effectively take away the freedom of bespoke descriptions (since it discourages / disallows custom headings). \r\n\r\nFinally, PR templates might alienate some users. I've come across some in other repos that come across as condescending. I personally think yours is acceptable, but some people might draw the line elsewhere.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nI realize the above sounds a bit negative, but like I said, that's just because you've covered the pros well already 😄\r\n","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118624#pullrequestreview-4148558660","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118624","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118624#pullrequestreview-4148558660"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/118624"}},"submitted_at":"2026-04-21T14:40:32Z","commit_id":"5198c7592e4c9369f740acfa9fdc164fe10709c5"}]